              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When it comes to expanding your fleet, investing in used dry freight truck bodies is a smart move. Whether you’re looking to grow your business, cut costs, or increase operational efficiency, choosing used truck bodies can offer numerous advantages. Dry freight truck bodies are a staple in the transportation industry, offering versatility, protection, and reliability for a wide range of cargo. If you’re considering adding one to your fleet, here are five key benefits of buying used.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
