                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "h-budget",
                          "type": "heading",
                          "props": {
                            "text": "Build Your Fleet Without Breaking the Bank",
                            "headingLevel": 2,
                            "align": "left",
                            "anchor": "budget"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-budget-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Expanding your fleet doesn’t have to come with a hefty price tag. Used dry freight truck bodies provide a cost-effective way to scale up your operations without the high expense of purchasing new equipment. Whether you’re launching a new business or growing an existing one, used truck bodies offer a budget-friendly way to meet increasing transportation demands.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-budget-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Buying used also allows you to reinvest in your equipment. You can customize your truck body with upgrades, retrofit it with advanced tracking technology, or reinforce its durability with maintenance—all while keeping overall costs lower than buying brand new.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
