                },
                {
                  "id": "p-reinvest-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "One of the most significant advantages of purchasing a used truck body is the cost savings. Well-maintained truck bodies can last for decades, making them a dependable investment at a fraction of the price of new models.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-reinvest-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "By cutting equipment costs, you free up capital to reinvest in other essential areas of your business—whether that’s hiring additional drivers, upgrading fleet management systems, or expanding your service routes. Choosing used truck bodies allows you to meet customer demands without sacrificing financial flexibility.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
