                  "id": "p-versatility-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Dry freight truck bodies are among the most versatile truck bodies on the market. They can transport a variety of dry goods, from food products and electronics to heavy machinery and construction materials. This versatility allows you to take on more business opportunities and diversify your hauling capabilities. They come in a range of sizes and options so you can find the model you need to take your business further.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
