                {
                  "id": "p-reliable-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Enclosed truck bodies help keep your goods safe and protected, ensuring they arrive in the best condition possible. Whether you’re handling sensitive shipments or everyday cargo, a secure and enclosed truck body provides peace of mind. These truck bodies are particularly essential for last-mile deliveries, ensuring products remain intact from the warehouse to their final destination.",
