                {
                  "id": "p-inventory-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At <a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a>, we offer a wide selection of high-quality dry freight truck bodies, including new and used options. We are proud to carry <a href=\"https://www.international.com/\">International brand</a> truck bodies, a brand known for its durability, innovation, and industry leadership. Our inventory includes a variety of truck bodies, such as those available with the International MV Series, eMV Series, CV Series, and more. Our locations in <a href=\"/locations/tampa\">Tampa</a>, <a href=\"/locations/davenport\">Davenport</a>, and <a href=\"/locations/sarasota\">Sarasota</a> make it easy to find the right truck body for your needs. Whether you’re in the market for a used dry freight truck body or looking to expand your entire fleet, our team is here to help.",
