                    "text": "When you shop at <a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a>, you’re getting more than just a truck body—you’re getting a trusted partner in the transportation industry. We’re committed to providing our customers with top-tier equipment, expert service, and <a href=\"/financing\">financing options</a> to ensure you get the best deal possible. <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=used\">Check out our selection of used dry van truck bodies</a> on our website or <a href=\"/contact\">visit us at one of our locations today!</a>",
